5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m a bit nervous about the ground here. Has anyone checked if the soil is stable enough for digging?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Cute question, Minato. I’m more worried about the price tag after the ribbon is cut. Who’s paying for the upkeep?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I’d like to see how the last decade’s projects are holding up, rather than just the pretty drawings.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I’m curious who will actually maintain this place day to day. The staffing rota seems to be shrinking every year.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m less interested in the brochure and more in how the ground and the people actually behave here.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, the upkeep is important, but if the ground shifts, the digging costs will jump anyway.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, fair point, but a stable hole still needs mowing. I’m looking at the long-term ledger, not just the initial dig.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, you’re right to look ahead. I’d like to see the condition of the works from the earlier programme, to check if they’ve lasted.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, that’s a good start. I’m also checking the groundskeeping roll to see who’s actually left to do the work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the roll is just a number. I need to know how the ground and the people actually behave here.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I agree. I want to check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving to see if they can handle the clay.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, I’ll check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare to see how much the city actually pays to keep things alive.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, I’ll look into the condition of works from the earlier programme to see what’s actually survived the last decade.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, I’ll check the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services to see who’s actually left to do the work.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, I’ll check the drainage callouts and August heat readings to see how the ground actually behaves under pressure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Shizue, I’ll also look at the depot phasing notes to see if we can keep the park open while digging.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I’ll also check the terms of the regional habitat fund to see if it covers the long-term costs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, I’ll also check the record of the eastern avenue planting to see if those trees are still standing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, I’ll also check the volunteer groups working with the division to see if they can fill the staffing gaps.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, I’ll also check the timed counts of weekday crossings to see how people actually move through the space.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
