37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: I’ve seen the earlier works. The basin held, but the civic hall apron is patched three times.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: The roll is down to seven. We buy in specialists, but the casual pool handles weekends.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: The data is blunt. Drainage callouts doubled, and heat readings spiked. The ground is already failing.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: I found only two firms left for the digging. They warned about the clay, but said small work is fine.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, that’s a relief. But @Shunichi, your heat data worries me. I’m checking the fund terms to see if we’re locked into expensive upkeep.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""May"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**May**: @Minato, that’s a relief. But @Shunichi, your heat data worries me. I’m checking the fund terms to see if we’re locked into expensive upkeep.""}]}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the fund only pays for planting and water, not hard surfaces. That matches my fear about the apron failing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Shizue**: @May, the fund only pays for planting and water, not hard surfaces. That matches my fear about the apron failing.""}]}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, that fund restriction is a trap. If we can’t afford the upkeep, the planting dies, just like the avenue.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the heat isn’t just a number; it’s the ground rejecting the current layout. We need a plan that works with the water, not against it.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Shunichi, exactly. If the fund only covers planting and water, we’re forced into a scheme that’s expensive to maintain.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Victoria, you’re right. The avenue trees died because aftercare was ignored. We can’t repeat that mistake with a new scheme.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Shizue, the avenue proves it. Without dedicated aftercare, even the best planting fails. We need a plan that fits our current staffing reality.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the casual pool is a stopgap, not a strategy. We need a design that doesn’t demand heroic maintenance from a skeleton crew.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Shunichi, I agree. The clay is risky, but if we keep the park open, we avoid the chaos.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Shunichi, agreed. A design that fights the water will bankrupt us. I need a plan that respects the fund’s limits.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @May, precisely. We must choose a plan that survives our current reality, not one that promises a paradise we cannot afford to keep.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Shunichi, the volunteer groups are active, but they can’t replace professional water management. We need a plan that doesn’t rely on goodwill.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, agreed. The ground is already failing. We need a plan that works with the water, not against it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
